OL,3,GNEWSASwinney suggests Scots will not
OL,4,Atravel further for health care under
OL,5,Areforms
OL,6,
OL,7,FScots should not have to travel further
OL,8,Ffor health care under the government's
OL,9,Fplans to cut the number of health
OL,10,Fboards from 14 to two, John Swinney has
OL,11,Fsuggested.
OL,13,FThe BBC asked the first minister about
OL,14,Fthe impact of such changes for people
OL,15,Fwho are already travelling long
OL,16,Fdistances - such as women living in the
OL,17,Ffar north who have to travel 100 miles
OL,18,Fdown the A9 to give birth in Inverness.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
