OL,3,GNEWSASwinney suggests Scots will not
OL,4,Atravel further for health care under
OL,5,Areforms
OL,6,
OL,7,FSwinney said it would "not be my
OL,8,Fintention" for people to travel
OL,9,Ffurther, with initial modelling showing
OL,10,Fthe country divided into two east and
OL,11,Fwest health boards.
OL,13,FHe also said he could not put a
OL,14,F"specific figure" on NHS job losses,
OL,15,Fbut he had been "open about the fact
OL,16,Fthat public sector employment will
OL,17,Ffall".
